{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can't afford to look away any longer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Subjectivation</strong>, you have to take matters into your own hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You tried to avert your eyes and forget what has been done. The perfectly tuned, entropy-draining electromagnetic waves caught up with you anyway.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, your only option is to return to the source of the signal. What you do with this oscillator is up to you, but you simply have to do <i>something</i>.\u00a0During your journey you\u2019ll rediscover what fate befell the snowy town\u00a0 - and use that knowledge to shape the future with your own two hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't afford to look away any longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And when you finally turn back, you will</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect keys, find useful items, and jot down notes</strong> to help you solve puzzles that will affect the story\u2019s outcome\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight off the town\u2019s  inhabitants </strong>warped into unrecognizable creatures by the corrupting signal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your body heat</strong> by finding the few rare sources of warmth in this wintery town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the town\u2019s exteriors and interiors</strong> with your trusty lighter and notebook in hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to those you've wronged\u00a0</strong>and find out whether you can convince them to find forgiveness in their now-frozen hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the town's future</strong> with the ways you solve the puzzles and approach the conversations you will be presented with</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635740?t=1773000112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635740?t=1773000112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635740/8be2b906266d75e3fe275e3aaf47b75fa5c3a736/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773000112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635740/8be2b906266d75e3fe275e3aaf47b75fa5c3a736/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773000112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Violence against humanoid creatures / enemies enacted by the player character in combat scenarios.\r\nNon-specific depiction of human-like flesh in abstract scenarios without a violent context."},"demos":[{"appid":4310000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can't afford to look away any longer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Subjectivation</strong>, you have to take matters into your own hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You tried to avert your eyes and forget what has been done. The perfectly tuned, entropy-draining electromagnetic waves caught up with you anyway.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, your only option is to return to the source of the signal. What you do with this oscillator is up to you, but you simply have to do <i>something</i>.\u00a0During your journey you\u2019ll rediscover what fate befell the snowy town\u00a0 - and use that knowledge to shape the future with your own two hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't afford to look away any longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And when you finally turn back, you will</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect keys, find useful items, and jot down notes</strong> to help you solve puzzles that will affect the story\u2019s outcome\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight off the town\u2019s  inhabitants </strong>warped into unrecognizable creatures by the corrupting signal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your body heat</strong> by finding the few rare sources of warmth in this wintery town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the town\u2019s exteriors and interiors</strong> with your trusty lighter and notebook in hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to those you've wronged\u00a0</strong>and find out whether you can convince them to find forgiveness in their now-frozen hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the town's future</strong> with the ways you solve the puzzles and approach the conversations you will be presented with</p></li></ul>","developers":["ADC-AX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635740/a9edf6e51b1475aec59dcd9d02c3d7f653bf19ff/header.jpg?t=1773000112","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635740/876709/13b414f8278d20269d2344d4573cddcb8d5d2096/1750407741/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745678824","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635740/876709/13b414f8278d20269d2344d4573cddcb8d5d2096/1750407741/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745678824","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3635740/876709/13b414f8278d20269d2344d4573cddcb8d5d2096/1750407741/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745678824","id":257130089,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130089/426047a174aec4bcfb19e34e5ab2310578bb0a3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745678824"}],"name":"Subjectivation","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6th Gen<br></li><li><strong